   <p>To his Excy
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Gov<hi rend="sup">r</hi></persName> of <placeName ref="cwgk:P001800">Kentucky</placeName></p>
<p>The undersigned very respectfully but earnestly request your excellency to remit a fine of Fifty dollars and Costs inflicted to day by the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000729">City Court</orgName> of <placeName ref="cwgk:P001002">Lexington</placeName> on <persName ref="cwgk:N00020148">Patrick Garrety</persName> for carrying concealed a deadly weapon,</p>
<p><hi><persName ref="cwgk:N00011566">Geo B Kinkead</persName></hi>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00004020">R. Hickman Prewitt</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00004829">John B Payne Sr.</persName>
<lb/><hi rend="underline">W. Payne</hi>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020131">J B, Cooper</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020133">W<hi rend="sup">m</hi> Campbell</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020151">W J Hornby</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020132">Alexander <unclear>Irvine</unclear></persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020152">A,, S,, Parker</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020153">J. Kastle Jr</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020155">W W Lowney</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020156">T. J. Lowney</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00020157">C <unclear/> Dennis</persName>
<lb/><hi rend="underline">G. B. Hale</hi></p>
